AudD  ·  profile default
                 │  Getting started   Guide   Commands   Keys  [Exit codes and …
 1 Recognize     │ Exit codes
 2 Listen        │   0    ok           success, including no match
 3 Now playing   │   1    unexpected   unexpected error, or no match with
 4 Streams       │                     --fail-on-no-match
 5 History       │   2    usage        invalid arguments or input, or a missing
 6 Account       │                     tool such as ffmpeg
 7 Settings      │   3    auth         missing or rejected API token, or sign-in
*8 Help          │                     needed (audd login)
                 │   4    quota        quota, plan, or feature not available on
                 │                     the account
                 │   5    network      network or server error; retrying may
                 │                     help
                 │   6    safety       a bound is missing (--limit,
                 │                     --max-files), a confirmation is needed
                 │                     (--yes), --max-requests was reached, or
                 │                     an unfinished job for the same files
                 │                     needs --resume or --new
                 │   7    partial      a batch finished with some files failed
 ctrl+k commands │   8    threshold    usage --check found fewer remaining
 ? keys  q quit  │                     requests than --min-remaining
